OL,3,ABulger killer's parole hearing to be
OL,4,Aheld in private
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames's mother Denise Fergus had
OL,7,Fdemanded that the hearing be held in
OL,8,Fpublic to help combat "misinformation"
OL,9,Fabout the case which had a
OL,10,F"retraumatising impact" on her.
